{"hw":"θεόμαντις","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">θεόμαντις</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">θεόμαντ-ις</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">εως</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one who has a spirit of prophecy, an inspired person</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22c</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Men.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">99c</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aristid.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.18J.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Gal.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.442</span> </span>.</div></div>"}